# === SOFTWARE ===
# Flatpak with Flathub (/etc/flatpak/remotes.d). GNOME Software handles Flatpak and, through
# PackageKit, pacman packages; KDE Discover handles Flatpak only (no packagekit-qt6: KDE and CachyOS
# advise against Discover managing pacman packages). Brave Origin comes from the AUR, built into
# [edex-os].
flatpak
packagekit
gnome-software
discover
flatpak-kcm
brave-origin-bin
